{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792790880, "covers_from": "2026-10-23T21:28:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-23T21:29:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792790940, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-23T21:28:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 66018, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "環境", "content": "市長您好\n我是居住在台北市士林區故宮路的市民。因故宮路車流量非常大噪音也大，希望能設置噪音照相取締。", "display_name": "士林代表 Jill Luo", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-23T21:28:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 12805, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "紅線違停易遮蔽視線、迫使行人與機車閃避，增加事故風險。建請市長加強科技執法，恢復高風險違規民眾檢舉，", "display_name": "松山代表 No.12,805", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-23T21:28:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 69549, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "環境", "content": "請問未來是否能推動台北市源頭減廢政策，鼓勵重複使用、減少一次性包裝，並提供無包裝商店租稅優惠或實質支", "display_name": "北投代表 佳欣（星宿）", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-23T21:28:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 54583, "sprite_key": "elephant_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "治安", "content": "現在毒品氾濫，毒駕頻傳，是否應該修法改列毒酒駕為蓄意謀殺罪起訴，未來市長如何做到毒品源頭打擊呢？", "display_name": "萬華代表 傑哥", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 12805, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 No.12,805", "district": "songshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 69549, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "display_name": "北投代表 佳欣（星宿）", "district": "beitou", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 54583, "sprite_key": "elephant_oldtown", "display_name": "萬華代表 傑哥", "district": "wanhua", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 70290, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_